  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance allocation for Ukraine investment framework &#xBF;Municipal, Infrastructure and Industrial Resilience programme plus&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action reflects the broad need to complement scarce capacities to structure and deliver optimal projects in both the public and the private spheres in Ukraine, given the immense strain on people and resources across the economy. The Action aims to address the insufficient availability of skills and resources to adequately scope investment leads, or to timely implement identified projects.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
